      "message": "This logic is now duplicated in 3 places, so maybe extract it to a helper function?\n\nMaybe even a generic one in buddy_memory.h, something like:\n\n```\nstatic inline struct hyp_page *hyp_phys_to_page_safe(phys_addr_t phys)\n{\n\tstruct mem_range range;\n\t\n\tif (!find_mem_range(phys, \u0026range))\n\t\treturn NULL;\n\t\t\n\treturn hyp_phys_to_page(phys);\n}\n```",
